\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509361/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/760f4bcbda7bb40b0a57354a763079a0_5075953132064620275.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e罐罐焖肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509529\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/22f79c7b3ec787840f76aaa5c5b339cb_171803550094849263.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"冰醋栗冰淇淋\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509529/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509529/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/22f79c7b3ec787840f76aaa5c5b339cb_171803550094849263.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e冰醋栗冰淇淋\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【没什么事。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那祝您用餐愉快，客人。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"7fjux18ypd6T1791212608515\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这个单子好了，好，还有这道菜，上菜了，一号桌！嗯？…怎么了？客人。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"k2p70oc6969T1789209451947\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【队伍中存在奥黛塔】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【纳费多夫】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎光临，奥黛塔小姐，今天还是老样子？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【奥黛塔】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e加一份冰淇淋。小份就好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e【纳费多夫】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没问题！稍后就来，请您先入座。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e（小份…小份…）\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e（奥黛塔小姐要的「小份冰淇淋」，究竟是多小才好呢…一个球？是不是有点少…）\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509529\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/22f79c7b3ec787840f76aaa5c5b339cb_171803550094849263.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"冰醋栗冰淇淋\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509529/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509529/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/22f79c7b3ec787840f76aaa5c5b339cb_171803550094849263.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e冰醋栗冰淇淋\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509530\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/f0e56f5e16465c458b21e5a7af7e166f_6623810673420626266.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"雪原上的雪球花\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509530/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509530/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/03/75610764/f0e56f5e16465c458b21e5a7af7e166f_6623810673420626266.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e雪原上的雪球花\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【你是这家店的老板？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是的，这家由兽怪搭建，兽怪经营，为整个至冬所有食客服务的餐厅…的老板，就是我。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e好了，您要来这儿只为了问这个，那恕我不能奉陪了，还有好多事要做呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【毛会不会掉进菜里…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然不会，我们的厨师会清理完浮毛再上厨，也尽可能保证料理烹饪期间不会抖落不该进去的东西…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果您…真的遇到了类似的情况，可以让侍者把菜撤走，我们重新为您做一份。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\"}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"秘闻馆情报","is_poped":false